        <li>Temporal trends: multi-year comparison to assess whether crises are accelerating</li>
        <li>Informal economy adjustment: reported salaries may undercount income in cities like Lagos, Cairo, and Manila</li>
        <li>Household size adjustment: single-occupant rent-to-salary ratios overstate burden in multi-earner households</li>
        <li>Social transfer effects: government housing subsidies, rent controls, and social benefits are not captured in this index</li>
